{
  "name": "ElevenLabs: post or script to voiceover MP3",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post -> voiceover (original)\nPOST `{ \"text\": \"...\", \"voice_id\": \"optional\" }` and get an MP3 back.\nCleans social-post text (links, hashtags, emoji) before sending it to ElevenLabs text-to-speech.\nCredential: Header Auth named `xi-api-key`.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "74bad15b-5fd1-5d5c-a45b-cf73c9cc2699",
      "name": "Note 1",
